WEBVTT

00:00:13.168 --> 00:00:15.078
[rings chiming]

00:00:15.078 --> 00:00:16.078
[rings chiming]

00:01:10.802 --> 00:01:12.257
[grunts]

00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:16.350
[male voice] So, I know
what you're thinking.

00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:18.890
Why is that incredibly
handsome hedgehog

00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:20.290
being chased by a madman

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:21.990
with a mustache
from the Civil War?

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:26.070
Well, to be honest,
it feels like I've been
running my whole life.

00:01:26.470 --> 00:01:28.370
Is this too much?
Am I going too fast?

00:01:28.910 --> 00:01:31.690
It's kind of what I do--
You know what? Let's back up.

00:01:31.798 --> 00:01:34.983
[mimicking reverse audio]

00:01:36.323 --> 00:01:39.690
["Friends"
by Hyper Potions plays]

00:01:39.799 --> 00:01:42.140
This is the island
where I'm from.

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:44.479
It had everything.

00:01:44.959 --> 00:01:46.979
Sandy beaches,
cascading waterfalls,

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:49.060
public access to loop-de-loops.

00:01:49.259 --> 00:01:51.299
And, I never had
to catch a school bus

00:01:51.299 --> 00:01:53.500
because I could run across
the entire island

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:54.799
in less than two seconds.

00:01:55.420 --> 00:01:56.900
Also, there was no school.

00:01:57.340 --> 00:01:59.340
I know,
pretty sweet island, right?

00:01:59.631 --> 00:02:00.479
Yeah!

00:02:00.479 --> 00:02:03.379
I was born
with extraordinary powers

00:02:03.379 --> 00:02:04.979
and was told
to keep them secret.

00:02:05.259 --> 00:02:08.139
And like any kid,
I did the exact opposite.

00:02:08.229 --> 00:02:09.229
[baby Sonic] Whoo-hoo!

00:02:10.459 --> 00:02:12.959
[Sonic] That's Longclaw.
She took care of me.

00:02:13.419 --> 00:02:15.139
She was basically
Obi-Wan Kenobi...

00:02:15.519 --> 00:02:17.539
if Obi-Wan Kenobi
had a beak and ate mice.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:20.199
Sonic, someone
could have seen you.

00:02:20.419 --> 00:02:23.039
No one saw me. I'm too fast!

00:02:23.360 --> 00:02:25.240
And I wanted to bring you this.

00:02:25.338 --> 00:02:26.630
[sighs]

00:02:26.729 --> 00:02:27.988
[gasps]

00:02:28.849 --> 00:02:29.849
Get down!

00:02:33.869 --> 00:02:35.390
[Sonic] Turns out,
with great power

00:02:35.390 --> 00:02:37.690
comes great
power-hungry bad guys.

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:39.470
And I led them right to us.

00:02:41.979 --> 00:02:43.286
[grunting]

00:02:43.392 --> 00:02:45.230
[arrows whistling]

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:49.012
[yells]

00:02:49.825 --> 00:02:51.946
[both grunting]

00:02:54.490 --> 00:02:55.770
Listen carefully, Sonic.

00:02:56.790 --> 00:02:59.750
You have a power unlike
anything I have ever seen.

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:02.390
And that means someone
will always want it.

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:06.170
The only way to stay safe
is to stay hidden.

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:12.349
This world is on the far side
of the universe.

00:03:12.889 --> 00:03:13.889
You should be safe there.

00:03:14.030 --> 00:03:16.729
I don't want to go without you.
You must.

00:03:17.009 --> 00:03:19.349
These rings will be your most
important possession.

00:03:19.450 --> 00:03:21.097
[pursuers shouting]
[gasps]

00:03:21.770 --> 00:03:23.048
[all panting]

00:03:23.150 --> 00:03:25.430
If you're ever discovered,
use one.

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:28.250
Never stop running.

00:03:29.895 --> 00:03:31.265
Now go!

00:03:33.335 --> 00:03:34.371
[all shouting]

00:03:34.462 --> 00:03:35.649
Longclaw!

00:03:36.959 --> 00:03:37.959
Goodbye, Sonic.

00:03:38.061 --> 00:03:39.163
No!

00:03:39.266 --> 00:03:40.918
[gasping]
[electricity crackling]

00:03:41.022 --> 00:03:43.156
No!

00:03:45.152 --> 00:03:47.527
[panting]

00:04:08.831 --> 00:04:10.449
Come on, one car?

00:04:15.096 --> 00:04:17.677
[making fast car noises]

00:04:17.780 --> 00:04:19.569
[groans]

00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:21.560
I'm bored.

00:04:21.621 --> 00:04:23.177
[man] Tom, do you read me?
Are you there?

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:27.060
No, Wade, I'm actually
on a yacht in Barbados.

00:04:28.079 --> 00:04:29.080
With Rihanna.

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:30.600
OMG. [chuckles]

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:32.860
That's amazing.
Please send pics.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:34.840
No, Wade.
I'm at the speed trap.

00:04:35.439 --> 00:04:38.440
Already?
How did you get back so fast?
Barbados is in the ocean!

00:04:38.740 --> 00:04:39.880
Hang on, I think
I got something.

00:04:44.622 --> 00:04:46.191
[beeping]

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:49.610
Hey, buddy! Where's the fire?

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:51.689
Got kids living around here.

00:04:53.150 --> 00:04:54.410
I thought that was
kind of funny.

00:04:54.550 --> 00:04:55.550
Sorry. [chuckles]

00:04:57.743 --> 00:05:00.190
[whooshing]
[radar beeps]

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:02.550
What?

00:05:06.222 --> 00:05:07.542
[clicks]

00:05:11.109 --> 00:05:12.785
[radar beeps]

